OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 1 Sep to Thu 10 Sep
OL,6,FLikely remaining unsettled with
OL,7,Fshowers or longer spells of rain
OL,8,Facross all areas at times. Rainfall
OL,9,Famounts will probably be above average
OL,10,Ffor the time year across many areas
OL,11,Fwith the wettest conditions in the
OL,12,Fnorthwest. Potential for some strong
OL,13,Fwinds at times. Some drier and more
OL,14,Fsettled interludes could develop,
OL,15,Fperhaps becoming longer in duration
OL,16,Facross southern areas later in this
OL,17,Fperiod. Temperatures are likely to be
OL,18,Fnear average, although some short-
OL,19,Flived warm or very warm spells are
OL,20,Fpossible, especially in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
