OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1787833095
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 10 Sep to Thu 24 Sep
OL,6,FMost likely a continuation of the
OL,7,Fgenerally unsettled conditions at
OL,8,Ffirst with showers or longer spells of
OL,9,Frain across many areas. However,
OL,10,Flikely some drier interludes at times.
OL,11,FFurther into September, drier weather
OL,12,Fmay become more prevalent, especially
OL,13,Fin the south and southeast, with more
OL,14,Funsettled conditions tending to become
OL,15,Fmore likely further north and
OL,16,Fnorthwest. Temperatures will probably
OL,17,Fbe near normal at first but may become
OL,18,Fwarmer later, with the possibility of
OL,19,Fsome hot spells in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
